  "metadata": {
    "policy": "Tracked backlog of ICU plural blocks that do not define every category the locale's own CLDR rules require (Intl.PluralRules(locale).resolvedOptions().pluralCategories) — the forge#N33 defect class. Missing categories silently fall back to `other` at runtime. The completeness test in apps/web/src/i18n/__tests__/messages-parity.test.ts is a ratchet: it fails on any gap NOT listed here and on any listed entry that is already fixed, so this file can only shrink. Fix a gap by adding the missing categories to that key's translated ICU string, then regenerate.",
